Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:41:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ISSUE-800 # Allow a minimal echo step without url and
 assertions

A step without a url makes no call and returns its request, and when
it has no assertions, verify or validators it passes without comparing
anything. Steps that make a real call still fail without assertions.
---
